        "evidence": "hecke-algebra-from-braiding.md:29-30 asserts q is 'a categorical datum — determined by the braiding ... not chosen freely', and lines 6-19 derive the Hecke relation (T-q)(T+q^{-1})=0 by *defining* q to be the braiding eigenvalue (line 17-18 'where q ∈ End(1) ... is the braiding eigenvalue').",
